Package: SpatialESS
Type: Package
Title: Efficient Edge-First Spatial Cell-Cell Communication
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("DENG", "Zifeng", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zifengd8@gmail.com")
Author: Zifeng DENG [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zifeng DENG <zifengd8@gmail.com>
Description: Provides an independent high-performance implementation
    compatible with the SpatialCellChat V3 statistical framework, together
    with an integrated single-sample spatial cell-cell communication workflow.
    Compact contact and diffusion graphs, exact sparse type-7 triMean
    summaries, streamed CellChat-compatible molecular scoring, and spatial
    block permutation reduce runtime and memory while preserving explicit
    numerical validation boundaries.
